      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:4:1:7:1",
      "text": [
        " أَرْضَاكُمْ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ أَسْبَغُكُمْ عَلَى عِيَالِهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad and Ahmad Bin Muhammad, altogether, from Al Hassan Bin Mahboub, from Malik Bin Atiyya, from Abu Hamza Al Sumaly, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Ali<sup>asws</sup> Bin Al-Husayn<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The ones of you most Pleased with in the Presence of Allah<sup>azwj</sup>, is the one most liberal bestower upon his dependants’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "1. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad and Ahmad ibn Muhammad all from al-Hassan ibn Mahbub from Malik ibn ‘Atiyyah from abu Hamzah al-Thumaliy who has said the following: “Ali ibn al-Husayn, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ’Of the people among you with whom Allah is most happy, is the one who improves the quality of life of his family the most.” "
        ]
      }
